<title>FINLAND: Tieto extends gains on strong Q1 earnings.</title>
<headline>Tieto extends gains on strong Q1 earnings.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Finnish data systems and software group TT Tieto Oy rose sharply on Wednesday, a day after it reported first quarter profits at the top of the range of analysts forecasts, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;It was a good result. There have been some upgradings of the company's profit forecasts,&quot; one broker said.</p>
<p>At 1420/1120 GMT, TT Tieto traded at a new life high 458.00 markka, up 32.00 markka or more than seven percent, in lively 10 million markka volume.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom, +358-9-680 50 235, news@reuters.fi</p>
